- Primary: `<x-primary-button>` (Safety Orange: `bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 dark:bg-orange-600 text-white`).
- Secondary: `<x-secondary-button>` (Bordered Gray: `bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600`).
- Danger: `<x-danger-button>` (Rose Red: `bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-700 dark:bg-rose-600 text-white`).
- Success: `<x-success-button>` (Emerald Green: `bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-600 text-white`).
- Warning: `<x-warning-button>` (Amber Yellow: `bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 dark:bg-amber-600 text-white`).
- Info: `<x-info-button>` (Indigo Blue: `bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 dark:bg-indigo-600 text-white`).
